{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2002 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "4dd6d6c95874d267d51551cc834d161703633df4ef4e436638073888d1c4f184" :edb/db-before-t 2001 :edb/db-after-t 2002 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535314 50 #inst "2026-10-13T17:24:31.563Z" 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186054711 1038 #edb/ref 17592186493944 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186054711 1038 #edb/ref 17592186493954 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186054712 1038 #edb/ref 17592186493921 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186062473 1078 #edb/ref 17592186062477 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186064277 1038 #edb/ref 17592186493900 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186064277 1038 #edb/ref 17592186493963 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186064736 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186064736 1071 "What is the coefficient of $x^{2}y$ in the product $(x - y)(x^{2} + 6xy - 9y^{2})$?" 13194139535314 17592186045417 false] [17592186064736 1071 "What is the coefficient of ${x}^{2}y$ in the product $(x-y)({x}^{2}+6xy-9{y}^{2})?$" 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186064736 1074 "We distribute all three terms of the binomial in the first set of parentheses to the trinomial in the second set of parentheses. Then, we simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-y)({x}^{2}+6xy-9{y}^{2}) & = \\\\ x({x}^{2}+6xy-9{y}^{2})+(-y)({x}^{2}+6xy-9{y}^{2}) & = \\\\ {x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}y-9x{y}^{2}-{x}^{2}y-6x{y}^{2}+9{y}^{3} & = \\\\ {x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}y-15x{y}^{2}+9{y}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coefficient of ${x}^{2}y$ is $5.$" 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186078598 1038 #edb/ref 17592186493974 13194139535314 17592186045417 true] [17592186081071 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081073 13194139535314 17592186045417 false] [17592186081071 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081074 13194139535314 17592186045417 false] [17592186081071 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081076 13194139535314 17592186045417 false] [17592186081071 1075 #edb/ref 17592